==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Cold Darner}}
Cold Darners can be found in cold regions of [[Hyrule]], such as [[Hyrule Ridge]] and the [[Tabantha Frontier]]. They can also be purchased from traveling merchants, such as [[Maypin]] and [[Beedle]] at the [[Kara Kara Bazaar]] and [[Woodland Stable]]. When [[Cooking|Cooked]], Cold Darners can be made into [[Elixir]]s that provide [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Cold Darners can be used to make [[Blue Dye]].

As part of the [[Side Quest]] "[[Little Sister's Big Request]]", [[Link]] must ask [[Gleema]] what the [[Insect]] she wants to see is. She will reveal that she once saw [[Dragonfly|Dragonflies]] in a [[Book]], and when she grows up, she wants to travel and see Dragonflies in real life.<ref name="BotW Gleema"/> Gleema was unwilling to tell her sister [[Jana]] that she wanted to see them because of Jana's distaste for them.<ref name="BotW Jana"/> However, because it is Gleema's birthday wish, Jana will ask Link to bring her the Dragonflies.<ref name="BotW Jana 2"/> Upon delivery, Jana grows disgusted by them asks Link to give them to Gleema instead.<ref name="BotW Jana 3"/> As a reward for completing this Quest, Jana will give Link a [[Silver Rupee]].<ref name="BotW Jana 4"/>

